WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.471
- [Kelly Clarkson] Did
you celebrate 23 years?

00:00:01.471 --> 00:00:03.811
- [Tim McGraw] 23 years in
October, this past October.

00:00:03.811 --> 00:00:04.867
(audience applauds)

00:00:04.867 --> 00:00:05.739
- What's your date?

00:00:05.739 --> 00:00:06.572
- October 6th.

00:00:06.572 --> 00:00:09.072
- Oh we are October 20th, yep.

00:00:10.019 --> 00:00:11.077
I was like I totally know it.

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:12.457
- It's the guy is supposed
to get that wrong.

00:00:12.457 --> 00:00:13.730
- No, no, no, my husband and I

00:00:13.730 --> 00:00:15.330
have both forgot two anniversaries.

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:16.540
- Oh wow.

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:18.450
- He was hunting and I was like asleep,

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:21.000
and they emailed us and they
were like, "happy anniversary!"

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.450
And we were like, "oh my God!"

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:24.940
He was, like, ordering flowers,

00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:26.470
and I was, like, calling
him, "oh, ha ha, love you."

00:00:26.470 --> 00:00:29.730
I was like, we totally forget, it's fine.

00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:30.910
But what did you do to celebrate?

00:00:30.910 --> 00:00:31.743
That's huge.

00:00:31.743 --> 00:00:35.200
- Gosh, I was in Australia
I think, this was the first

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:36.253
anniversary that we were apart.

00:00:36.253 --> 00:00:37.230
- Oh no.

00:00:37.230 --> 00:00:40.560
- Yeah, but we were backstage
and I recorded the very first

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:42.220
song that we ever did together.

00:00:42.220 --> 00:00:44.530
We did the Spontaneous
Combustion Tour, where we met,

00:00:44.530 --> 00:00:45.630
when she was opening for me

00:00:45.630 --> 00:00:47.410
on my very first headlining tour,

00:00:47.410 --> 00:00:48.927
and we used to do the Tony Rich song,

00:00:48.927 --> 00:00:50.490
"Nobody Knows But Me".

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.910
- ♪ Nobody knows it but me ♪

00:00:52.910 --> 00:00:53.743
I love that one, yeah.

00:00:53.743 --> 00:00:56.030
- So I recorded that backstage
with the guys, and we

00:00:56.030 --> 00:00:57.130
sent it to her for our anniversary.

00:00:57.130 --> 00:00:58.453
- Oh yeah, that's cute.

00:00:58.453 --> 00:00:59.286
Okay.
- So that

00:00:59.286 --> 00:01:00.119
was my anniversary gift.

00:01:00.119 --> 00:01:01.380
- That was pretty cute.

00:01:01.380 --> 00:01:03.840
So I just saw two of your
kids backstage, but your two

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:05.430
oldest kids are out of the house.

00:01:05.430 --> 00:01:07.660
Are y'all excited about
being empty nesters?

00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:09.690
- I don't know if we are
excited about it, we miss them,

00:01:09.690 --> 00:01:10.950
Gracie and Maggie-

00:01:10.950 --> 00:01:11.975
- You are such good parents.

00:01:11.975 --> 00:01:14.026
- And we miss them.

00:01:14.026 --> 00:01:15.473
- I'm gonna be like, bye!

00:01:18.190 --> 00:01:19.317
I love 'em but bye!

